<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f6f9fc;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 28px 24px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #22c55e;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin: 24px 0 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .chat-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #6366f1;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 10px 18px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }

      .logo-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .logo-header img {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .logo-header h1 {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin: 0;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #111827;
      }

      .footer {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #999;
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo-header">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/3119/3628/files/logo2.png?v=1746194276" alt="COD King Logo" />
        <h1>COD King</h1>
      </div>

      <h2>Hello <%= @name %>,</h2>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
        We noticed you haven’t enabled any features yet. Is there anything we can help you with?
      </p>

      <p>
        Most merchants who activate COD King start seeing <strong>reduced RTOs and increased prepaid conversions</strong> within days.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you are stuck or unsure, book a free walkthrough — we will guide you personally.
      </p>

      <a href="https://calendly.com/adbhatia1989/30min" class="button" target="_blank">
        📞 Book a Free Demo Call
      </a>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" class="chat-button" target="_blank">
          💬 Chat with Support
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>Need help? Email us at <a href="mailto:support@notifiktech.com" style="color: #3b82f6;">support@notifiktech.com</a></p>
        <p>Watch tutorials on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@cod-king-shopify" target="_blank" style="color: #3b82f6;">YouTube</a></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Automated check-in from COD King.</p>
        <a href="http://app.codking.tech/unsubscribe?email=<%= @email %>&source=inactivity_reengagement_nudge"
        style="color: #999; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12px;">
            Unsubscribe from future reminders
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
